<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="PHP" style="id">- Nkangala New Testament Zambia</book>
  <para style="h">Filipu</para>
  <para style="toc1">Mukanda ua Paulu kuli vaka Filipu</para>
  <para style="toc2">Filipu</para>
  <para style="toc3">Fili</para>
  <para style="mt2">Mukanda ua Paulu kuli vaka</para>
  <para style="mt1">FILIPU</para>
  <para style="imt">Citsindikisi</para>
  <para style="ip">Paulu uasonekelele ou mukanda kuli vaka kutsiliela va mu Filipu mu miaka makumi atanu na limo na muaka umo hanima ya kutsa ca Yesu (61 AD). Uausonekele oku tele acili mu kamenga (1: 13), capuile mu Loma. Ou mukanda uausonekelele ku cikungulukilo cije cakele mu nganda ya Filipu. Tuasa kulilongesaho viavindende ha via Filipu mu livulu lia Vilinga. Filipu yapuile nganda yakama ya mbonge mu Masendonia. Kaha naua yapuile cikungulukilo cakulivanga cije civatungile mu Masendonia. Paulu na Silasi vaputukile eci cikungulukilo hamolika kaha naua vavahakele na mu kamenga ha vutsiki vumo oku tele vacili kuje (Vilinga 16).</para>
  <para style="ip">Paulu hamo uakele na matumbe amengi mukusoneka ou mukanda. Ualikuasesele vintsimbu vimo mukutsatsela cikungulukilo ha vuana vuje vuvatumine omo vevuile nguavo ali mu kamenga (4: 10-19). Kaha naua uavalumbunuine tumamesi yendi muje vati uakelelelemo mu kamenga kaha uahandekele viacili hali Timateo na Epafolonditusi ku cikungulukilo (2: 19-30) linga vavatambule muacili nakusingimika vuntuama vuavo.</para>
  <para style="iot">Muvanavitumbikilamo:</para>
  <para style="io1">1. Paulu aputuka mukanda mukuhinduisa cikungulukilo ca mu Filipu (1: 1-2).</para>
  <para style="io1">2. Cakuhatako Paulu ahandeka vimpande vimo via katumamesi kendi na visinganieka vije viakala navio (1: 3; 2:30).</para>
  <para style="io1">3. Ambahoni ahane vishika viavingi via katumamesi muje muvanapande kuyoyelamo vaka Yesu (3: 1; 4:9).</para>
  <para style="io1">4. Paulu amanusula nakutsantsela vantu va mu cikungulukilo ca mu Filipu ha vuana vuavo kaha nakuvatuma vihindu (4: 10-23).</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="PHP 1"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PHP 1:1"/>Kuhuminina kuli yange Paulu na Timateo, vangamba va Kilistu Yesu,</para>
  <para style="p" vid="PHP 1:1">Ku voshe vantu va Njambi muli Kilistu Yesu vaje vali ku Filipu, hamo na vantuama na vakuasi va cikungulukilo:<verse eid="PHP 1:1"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PHP 1:2"/>Kavumbi na ciyulo vikale kuli yeni vije vihuminina kuli Njambi Tatetu na Muene Yesu Kilistu.<verse eid="PHP 1:2"/></para>
  <para style="s">Lilombelo lia Paulu ku Vantuama vendi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PHP 1:3"/>Njikatsantsela Njambi yange mu vintsimbu vioshe vije njikamianuka. <verse eid="PHP 1:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="PHP 1:4"/>Mu malombelo ange oshe hali yeni voshe, njikalombela na nzolela, <verse eid="PHP 1:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="PHP 1:5"/>kutsatsela muje mutunapangela hamo mu vipangi via muzimbu uacili kuhuma ha litangua lia kulivanga nakuheta kulelo. <verse eid="PHP 1:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="PHP 1:6"/>Cilivene njatantekeya nguange uje uaputukile cipangi cacili muli yeni akacitualelelaho nakukufua ha litangua lia Yesu Kilistu. <verse eid="PHP 1:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="PHP 1:7"/>Canjipande yange kuvua ngacije hali yeni voshe, omuo njamihaka ku mutima uange, omuo yeni voshe muli hamo nange mu kavumbi, mu vioshe, cipue njili mu kamenga, cipue mukuamena na mukukolesa muzimbu uacili ngoo. <verse eid="PHP 1:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="PHP 1:8"/>Omuo Njambi ikeye mukaleho uange uje atantekeya muje vati njimitonda yeni voshe na cizango cije cihuminina kuli Kilistu Yesu.<verse eid="PHP 1:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PHP 1:9"/>Kaha eli likelio lilombelo liange nguange cizango ceni citualeleleho mukukola cikuma, na mana nakumona ca vusunga, <verse eid="PHP 1:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="PHP 1:10"/>linga muase kumona viacili nakupua vakulela nakuhona kapayo ha litangua lia Kilistu, <verse eid="PHP 1:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="PHP 1:11"/>mukashula na vushuka vuacili vuje vukeja kuhitila muli Yesu Kilistu ku vumpau nakushangazala ca Njambi.<verse eid="PHP 1:11"/></para>
  <para style="s">Kuyoya cinapu Kilistu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PHP 1:12"/>Njitonda yeni vavusamba vange mutantekeye ngeci vije vinalingiua kuli yange vinakuasa kutuala muzimbu uacili kulutue. <verse eid="PHP 1:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="PHP 1:13"/>Ha cuma eci linga vaka kuniunga lipela na voshe vatantekeye ngeci njili mu kamenga omuo ya Kilistu. <verse eid="PHP 1:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="PHP 1:14"/>Kaha vaka kutsiliela vavengi vanakolesa muli Muene omuo ya kukala kuange mu kamenga, kaha vanasimpi cikuma mukuambulula lizi lia Njambi kuakuhona liova.<verse eid="PHP 1:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PHP 1:15"/>Vamo cilivene vambulula Kilistu na lifuua na vimpata, vuno honi vamo na cizango cacili. <verse eid="PHP 1:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="PHP 1:16"/>Ava vakukotokela vacilinga omuo ya cizango, vatantekeya ngeci yange vananjihaka mu kamenga omuo yakuamena muzimbu uacili. <verse eid="PHP 1:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="PHP 1:17"/>Ava vakulivanga vambuluile Kilistu na cimbembesi ca kulihalesa, keti mu vusunga vuno honi valinakuyongola ngeci vavuezeleleko ku tuyando tuange omuo njili mu kamenga. <verse eid="PHP 1:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="PHP 1:18"/>Kaha vatihoni? Muli ili yoshe ngila, cipue mu kulikuisa cipue mu vusunga vumbanda lika valinakuambulula Kilistu, kaha ha cuma eci njivuahelela. <verse eid="PHP 1:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="PHP 1:19"/>Cilivene, kaha njikavuahelela. Omuo njatantekeya nguange kuhitila mu malombelo eni nakukuasa ca Cimbembesi ca Yesu Kilistu vikanjipatula. <verse eid="PHP 1:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="PHP 1:20"/>Cizango cange cakama na kutsiliela cange ngeci kunjikevu shuama vuno honi nakusimpa coshe hano na vintsimbu vioshe Kilistu vakamuhana kasingimiko mu muvila uange, cipue mu kuyoa cange cipue mu kutsa cange. <verse eid="PHP 1:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="PHP 1:21"/>Omuo kuli yange kuyoya cinapu Kilistu, kaha kutsa cinapu nganio. <verse eid="PHP 1:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="PHP 1:22"/>Nga muono hanga ucikala mu muvila, kaha eci cilumbununa vipangi viacili hali yange. Kaha tahi kunjasa kuhandeka cuma muka njapande kuhangula. <verse eid="PHP 1:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="PHP 1:23"/>Vananjipalakana ku viuma evi vivali. Cizango cange cinapu kuya nakukala na Kilistu, eci cikeco cinahiana cikuma. <verse eid="PHP 1:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="PHP 1:24"/>Vuno honi cakama cikuma omuo yeni, nga kunjaciyoya tahi. <verse eid="PHP 1:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="PHP 1:25"/>Njatantekeya muacili cuma eci, nankuma njatantekeya nguange njikakala nakutualelelaho neni voshe, omuo yakuvuezelela ceni nakuvuahelela mu lutsilielo, <verse eid="PHP 1:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="PHP 1:26"/>ngeci muli yange mukase kulihalesa kuje kuneha vumpau muli Kilistu Yesu omuo yakuija cange naua kuli yeni.<verse eid="PHP 1:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="PHP 1:27"/>Kaha katumamesi keni mu vuyoye kapue lika kaseho ya muzimbu uacili ua Kilistu linga hamo njikeja nakumimona cipue hamo njiuahiko, njikevue nguavo muakolesa mu cimbembesi cimo lika, na mana amo aje atsiliela noku noku omuo ya lutsilielo lua muzimbu uacili, <verse eid="PHP 1:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="PHP 1:28"/>keti mukale na liova lia vitozi veni. Eci cikeco cimueso kuli vakevo ngeci mukavahiana, vuno honi ya kuovoka ceni cije cihuminina kuli Njambi. <verse eid="PHP 1:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="PHP 1:29"/>Omuo vanamitumbuilaco nguavo omuo ya Kilistu, kumukatsiliela lika vuno honi naua mukayanda omuo yendi, <verse eid="PHP 1:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="PHP 1:30"/>neni muakundama ku nzita ije muamuene njakele nayo, naua hangavene ikeyo ije muli nakuivua injicili nayo.<verse eid="PHP 1:30"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PHP 1"/>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="PHP 2"/>
  <para style="s">Kulikehesa ca Kilistu na Vukama Vuendi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PHP 2:1"/>Kaha nga kuli kulikolesa kumo muli Kilistu, kaha nga nakuzembeleka kumo kuhuma ha cizango cendi, kaha nga muli nakulitombola kumo muli Cimbembesi, nga ngozi imo cipue nga kulitetela, <verse eid="PHP 2:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="PHP 2:2"/>kaha njipuiseni uakuvuahelela mukukala na mana amo, na cizango cimo, nakupua umo mu cimbembesi na mana amo. <verse eid="PHP 2:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="PHP 2:3"/>Keti mulinge cuma cimo na viyongola via cipululu cipue nakulishasha, vuno honi mukulikehesa kaha ambateni vakueni muvulemu kupulakana yeni vavenia. <verse eid="PHP 2:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="PHP 2:4"/>Keti mukale lika kulivuahelesa yeni vavenia vuno honi lingeni vije vivuahelesa na vakueni naua. <verse eid="PHP 2:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="PHP 2:5"/>Kaleni na mana aua mukati keni, aje anapu eni muli Kilistu Yesu:<verse eid="PHP 2:5"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PHP 2:6"/>Uje cipuevene uakele mu cifua ca Njambi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PHP 2:6">vuno honi kayonguele kupua hamo na Njambi cuma cakukakateya.<verse eid="PHP 2:6"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PHP 2:7"/>Vuno honi ualipuisile ikeye vavenia uakuhona seho,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PHP 2:7">ualiambatele ngue ngamba,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PHP 2:7">kaha uasemukile mucifua ca vuntu.<verse eid="PHP 2:7"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PHP 2:8"/>Omuo uakele mucifua ca vuntu, ualikehesele ikeye vavenia nakuononoka noho kutsa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PHP 2:8">cipue vene ha kutsa ca ha cilindakano.<verse eid="PHP 2:8"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PHP 2:9"/>Nankuma, Njambi namujundula cikuma</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PHP 2:9">nakumuhana lizina lije lili helu lia mazina oshe,<verse eid="PHP 2:9"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PHP 2:10"/>linga ha lizina lia Yesu livuli lili lioshe likatsikama,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PHP 2:10">muilu, na ha mavu, na muntsi lia mavu,<verse eid="PHP 2:10"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PHP 2:11"/>kaha na ndaka ili yoshe ikambulula nguayo Yesu Kilistu ikeye Muene,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PHP 2:11">ku vumpau vua Njambi Tate.<verse eid="PHP 2:11"/></para>
  <para style="s">Tueni Ceke ha Mavu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PHP 2:12"/>Nankuma, vacizango cange, ngue mumuno nonokelamo ntsimbu yoshe, nkuma hano honi, keti lika omuo njiliko vuno honi cikuma kuma nganjiuahiko, pangeleni kuovoka ceni na liova nakujujukua. <verse eid="PHP 2:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="PHP 2:13"/>Omuo Njambi alinakupanga muli yeni, linga mukale na cizango nakupanga ha cipangi cendi cacili.<verse eid="PHP 2:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PHP 2:14"/>Pangeni viuma vioshe kuakuhona kulinienieta cipue vimpata, <verse eid="PHP 2:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="PHP 2:15"/>linga mukapue vakuhona kapayo nakusamba, vana va Njambi vakuhona kapayo mukati ka cikota ca lizangamena na makuli. Hali vakevo mukaviakuma ngue vieke ha mavu, <verse eid="PHP 2:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="PHP 2:16"/>muka kakateye ku lizi lia muono, linga ha litangua lia Kilistu njikalihalesa nguange nzili yange na vipangi viange kuviaile muangoco.<verse eid="PHP 2:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PHP 2:17"/>Cipue vene nga vanjitila ngue viakunua ha nkombelo yakukombelela lutsilielo lueni, njivuahelela nakujolela neni voshe. <verse eid="PHP 2:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="PHP 2:18"/>Mumolika vene neni naua munapande kuvuahelela nakujolela nange.<verse eid="PHP 2:18"/></para>
  <para style="s">Timateo na Epafolonditusi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PHP 2:19"/>Njatsiliela muli Muene Yesu kutuma Timateo kuli yeni vuavuno linga akunjivuahelese na muzimbu uakuhuma kuli yeni. <verse eid="PHP 2:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="PHP 2:20"/>Kunjesi naueka uakulifua ngue ikeye, uje asa kushoshomua cihindu ceni. <verse eid="PHP 2:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="PHP 2:21"/>Voshe valinakulimuena vije vivatonda vakevo vavenia, keti vije viatonda Yesu Kilistu. <verse eid="PHP 2:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="PHP 2:22"/>Vuno honi muatantekeya vati Timateo muje muanalisholola vukaleho vuendi, ngue muje muana muakapanga na ishe, mukemo muanapanga hamo nange mu muzimbu uacli. <verse eid="PHP 2:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="PHP 2:23"/>Nankuma, njatsiliela kumutuma vuavuno kuya muje viuma muvikanjendelamo. <verse eid="PHP 2:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="PHP 2:24"/>Kaha njatsiliela muli Muene nguange nange naua vuavuno njija.<verse eid="PHP 2:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="PHP 2:25"/>Njasinganieka nguange cinapande kutuma Epafolonditusi kuli yeni, uje ikeye muanetu na mukuetu mutukapangela na mukuetu lisualale, ikeye kanganda keni na mukuasi ku vipangi viange. <verse eid="PHP 2:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="PHP 2:26"/>Ikeye uamitonda cikuma yeni voshe, kaha nashoto mutima omuo munevu nguavo navavalele. <verse eid="PHP 2:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="PHP 2:27"/>Cilivene navavalele, nakutonda kutsa. Vuno honi Njambi nakala na cikeketima hali ikeye, keti lika hali ikeye vuno honi na hali yange naua, nakunjitetela linga keti njikale na vusiua ha vusiua. <verse eid="PHP 2:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="PHP 2:28"/>Nankuma, njili nakutonda cikuma kumutuma linga muakuvuahelele omo muakumumona naua, linga nange naua keti njishote mutima. <verse eid="PHP 2:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="PHP 2:29"/>Nkuma mutambuleni muli Muene na nzolela yoshe, nakuhana kasingimiko kuli vamala vangacije, <verse eid="PHP 2:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="PHP 2:30"/>omuo natondele kutsa ha vipangi via Kilistu nakuhaka muono uendi muvukalu linga amanese vipangi vieni kuli yange.<verse eid="PHP 2:30"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PHP 2"/>
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="PHP 3"/>
  <para style="s">Vusunga Vuacili</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PHP 3:1"/>Mukumanusuila, vamuanetu, joleleni muli Muene. Kunjesi nashuama yakusonekela kuli yeni vuima viakulifua, kaha eci cimikuasa yeni. <verse eid="PHP 3:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="PHP 3:2"/>Litengeni kuli vaje vaka kulinga vupi, vaje tutali, litengeni kuli vaje vaka kunongesa ntsitu. <verse eid="PHP 3:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="PHP 3:3"/>Omuo yetu tuapua vakulovoka va vusunga, vaje valemesa Njambi mu Cimbembesi, na vumpau muli Kilistu Yesu. Kaha kutuekutsiliela mu vuntu. <verse eid="PHP 3:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="PHP 3:4"/>Cipue vene yange vavenia njili na cuma cakutsiliela mu vuntu. Nga kuli umo asinganieka nguendi ali na cuma ha kutsiliela mu vuntu, kaha yange njili naviavingi. <verse eid="PHP 3:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="PHP 3:5"/>Kutuhuka ha litangua lia mucitanu na atatu, ku vantu va Isaleli, ku muyati ua Mbenjamine, Kahevelu uakusemuka ku Vahevelu, ngue ku lishiko lia Kafaliseo, <verse eid="PHP 3:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="PHP 3:6"/>ngue ntuima yakama mukupakesa cikungulukilo, ngue ku vusunga vua lishiko kuakuhonoua mulonga. <verse eid="PHP 3:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="PHP 3:7"/>Vuno honi viuma vioshe via nganio vije njakele navio, njavitandele kupua viangoco omuo ya Kilistu. <verse eid="PHP 3:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="PHP 3:8"/>Cilivene njilinakutanda vioshe kupua viangoco omuo ha seho yakama ya kutantekeya Kilistu Yesu Muene uange. Omuo yendi njinamono viuma vioshe kupua viangoco nakuvitanda viakuhona seho linga njinganiale Kilistu <verse eid="PHP 3:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="PHP 3:9"/>nakukala muli ikeye, linga keti njikale na vusunga vuange lika vuje vuakundama ha lishiko, vuno honi vuje vuahitila mu lutsilielo muli Kilistu, vusunga vuje vuhuminina kuli Njambi vuje vuakundama ha lutsilielo. <verse eid="PHP 3:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="PHP 3:10"/>Linga njitantekeye Kilistu na nzili ya kusanguka cendi, na kulipangela tuyando tuendi nakupua ngue ikeye mukutsa cendi, <verse eid="PHP 3:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="PHP 3:11"/>linga nga casiua hamo vaka njisangule ku vatsi.<verse eid="PHP 3:11"/></para>
  <para style="s">Kutunta kuheta naku Ntsongo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PHP 3:12"/>Keti ngue nguavo njinahiana laja cuma eci cipue nguavo njinalele laja houe. Vuno honi njilinakutualelelaho linga njicipuise cange, omuo Kilistu Yesu nanjipuisa uendi. <verse eid="PHP 3:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="PHP 3:13"/>Vamuanetu, kunjekusinganieka nguange njacipuisa cange, vuno honi cuma cimo njilinakulinga eci, kusuva viakunima nakutualelelaho na vije vilikulutue. <verse eid="PHP 3:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="PHP 3:14"/>Njilinakutualelelaho lutue linga njiuane vuana vuje Njambi nanjisanena cikuma kuhitila muli Kilistu Yesu. <verse eid="PHP 3:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="PHP 3:15"/>Yetu vaje tunakolo mu mana tunapande kukala na mana acifua eci, kaha nga mu vintsimbu vimo tusinganieka viakuliseza, kaha Njambi akacisholola naua kuli yeni. <verse eid="PHP 3:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="PHP 3:16"/>Tuyeni lika tukakateye mua vusunga kuli vije vitunauana. <verse eid="PHP 3:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="PHP 3:17"/>Vamuanetu, lipandakaneneni hamo mu kunjitemuinina, hakeleni mana kuli vaje vayoya ngue muje mutualingile yetu. <verse eid="PHP 3:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="PHP 3:18"/>Omuo ngue muje munjamilekesele laja vintsimbu viavingi na hano vene njimilekesa naua honi na misozi nguange, yoyeni ngue vitozi va cilindakano ca Kilistu. <verse eid="PHP 3:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="PHP 3:19"/>Mamanusuililo avo akapua akunonga, njambi yavo ikeye mazimo avo na vumpau vuavo vuli mu shuama yavo, na mana akusinganieka via mavu lika. <verse eid="PHP 3:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="PHP 3:20"/>Vuno honi yetu vukalo vuetu vuli muilu, kaha hali vukevuo tulina kuvandamena Musoyesi, ikeye Muene Yesu Kilistu, <verse eid="PHP 3:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="PHP 3:21"/>uje akatengulula mivila yetu ya kutsa yakuzeya kupua ngue muvila uendi ua vumpau, na nzili ije ikamulingisa linga anehe viuma vioshe kuli ikeye vavenia.<verse eid="PHP 3:21"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PHP 3"/>
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="PHP 4"/>
  <para style="s">Vishika</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PHP 4:1"/>Nankuma, vamuanetu, vaje vanjazanga nacishota mutima, nzolela yange na cilongo cange hanga vinemana ngoo muli Muene, vamuanetu vanjazanga. <verse eid="PHP 4:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="PHP 4:2"/>Njilambelela Eundiya na Sintike linga valitavasane muli Muene. <verse eid="PHP 4:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="PHP 4:3"/>Kaha njikulomba nove naua mutuapangela hamo ua vusunga, kuasa ava vampuevo omuo vanapanga cikuma hamo nange mu vioshe mu muzimbu uacili na Kelemente na vaje voshe mutuapangelele hamo, vaje mazina avo ali mu livulu lia muono. <verse eid="PHP 4:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="PHP 4:4"/>Joleleni muli Muene ntsimbu yoshe, naua njikahandeka nguange, joleleni.<verse eid="PHP 4:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PHP 4:5"/>Vantu voshe vatantekeye kalemeso keni. Muene alimuyehi. <verse eid="PHP 4:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="PHP 4:6"/>Keti mushoshomue ha cuma cimo, vuno honi mu vioshe ha lilombe nakulihana nakutsantsela eceleni vije vimulomba vavitantekeye kuli Njambi. <verse eid="PHP 4:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="PHP 4:7"/>Kaha ciyulo ca Njambi cije cipulakana kuvuisisa coshe, cikatulika mitima yeni na viyongola vieni muli Kilistu Yesu.<verse eid="PHP 4:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PHP 4:8"/>Mukumanusuila, vamuanetu, vioshe vije viavusunga, vioshe vije via kasingimiko, vioshe vije viakuvuaha, vioshe vije viakulela, vioshe vije via cizango, vioshe vije via kavumbi, nga kuli vucili, nga kuli vimo via seho kupulakana kushangala, kaha singaniekeni ha viuma evi. <verse eid="PHP 4:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="PHP 4:9"/>Vioshe vije vimunalilongesa nakutambula nakuivua nakumona muli yange, vilingeni kaha Njambi ua ciyulo akakala neni.<verse eid="PHP 4:9"/></para>
  <para style="s">Kutsatsela ha Vuana</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PHP 4:10"/>Njijolela cikuma muli Muene nguange honi kumamanusuilo kunjihakela mana kueni cinahinduka, cilivene muakele nakunjihakela mana vuno honi kumuakele na ntsimbu yakucimuesa. <verse eid="PHP 4:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="PHP 4:11"/>Keti ngue nguavo munjihandekevi kaha kuli vimo njinajena, omuo njinalilongesa, mu ngila yoshe njilimo, njinapande kupuisamo. <verse eid="PHP 4:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="PHP 4:12"/>Njatantekeya muje mucafua kukala mukuzena, kaha njitantekeya muje mucafua kukala naviavingi, muli vioshe na mu vintsimbu vioshe njinalilongesa vushueke vuakumona viavingi cipue njala, viavingi kupulakana cipue mukuzena. <verse eid="PHP 4:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="PHP 4:13"/>Njasa kulinga viuma vioshe kuhitila muli ikeye uje akanjitakamesa. <verse eid="PHP 4:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="PHP 4:14"/>Capuile ngozi yeni linga tulipangele tuyando tuange. <verse eid="PHP 4:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="PHP 4:15"/>Yeni vene vavenia vaka Filipu muatantekeya ngueni hambangelo ya muzimbu uacili, omo njahumine ku Masendoniya, nacimo cahi cikungulukilo calipandakanene nange mukuhana na mukutambula kuvanga lika yeni. <verse eid="PHP 4:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="PHP 4:16"/>Omuo cipue vene mu Tesalonika muanjitumine vukuasi vintsimbu viavingi. <verse eid="PHP 4:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="PHP 4:17"/>Keti nguavo njitonda vuana, vuno honi njitonda vushuka vuje vuvuezelela ku mbango yeni. <verse eid="PHP 4:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="PHP 4:18"/>Njatambula fueto yakushula, na viavingi, njinapuisamo, ha kutambula vuana vuje vumuatumine ku Epafolonditusi, vuje vua mulambu ua mazi akunika luengo luacili, na nkombelo ije yatambula nakumuvuahelesa Njambi. <verse eid="PHP 4:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="PHP 4:19"/>Kaha Njambi yange akamihana vioshe vije munazena kuya ku vufuko vuendi mu vumpau muli Kilistu Yesu. <verse eid="PHP 4:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="PHP 4:20"/>Kuli Njambi yetu na Tatetu kukale vumpau miaka yoshe ya yaye! Ameni.<verse eid="PHP 4:20"/></para>
  <para style="s">Vihindu Viakumanusuila</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="PHP 4:21"/>Vihindu kuli voshe vantu va Njambi muli Kilistu Yesu. Vaka kutsiliela ava vali nange vanamihana vihindu. <verse eid="PHP 4:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="PHP 4:22"/>Vantu va Njambi voshe kuno vanamitumu vihindu, cikuma kuma vaje vaku lipela lia Kayafase.<verse eid="PHP 4:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="PHP 4:23"/>Kavumbi ka Muene Yesu Kilistu kakale na cimbembesi ceni.<verse eid="PHP 4:23"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PHP 4"/>
</usx>
